config BK7258_SDK_TIMER_SELFTEST
	bool "Beken SDK software-timer lifecycle regression test"
	default n
	depends on ARCH_CHIP_BK7258 && !BK7258_AP_CORE && SYSTEM_NSH
	select BUILTIN
	select NSH_BUILTIN_APPS
	---help---
		Build the bktimertest NSH command.  It repeatedly deletes a periodic
		SDK timer from inside its own callback and proves that callbacks run
		in the board timer-service task rather than the NuttX watchdog ISR.
		This is the regression gate for the SDK wrapper's deferred-free
