config BK7258_GPIO_LOWERHALF
	bool "BK7258 selected-board NuttX GPIO lower-half"
	default n
	depends on BK7258_SDK_IRQ_BRIDGE
	select DEV_GPIO
	---help---
		Register the selected board's LED as /dev/gpio0 and its user key as
		/dev/gpio1 through the standard NuttX GPIO
		upper half. The key supports one selected rising or falling edge
		at a time; level, both-edge, wakeup and debounce modes are not
		supported. If the board LED pin is owned by UART1 or the selected
		P0/P1 SWD route, /dev/gpio0 is omitted without remuxing that pin.
		A validation application is selected separately.

