config BK7258_DMA2D
	bool "BK7258 DMA2D graphics accelerator helper"
	default n
	depends on BK7258_AP_CORE && BK7258_PM_CLOCK
	select BK7258_SDK_IPC_RUNTIME
	help
		Build a typed AP-side helper for synchronous fill, copy and pixel
		conversion, and alpha blending through the official v3.1.1.9 DMA2D
		driver.  NuttX has no generic DMA2D upper half, so this option does
		not publish a private character device.  A framebuffer or video owner
		must explicitly initialize the singleton and retain ownership while an
		operation is active.

		The caller owns buffer lifetime and cache coherency.  Scale and rotate
		operations remain separate from this helper.

